Size the JIT alternate signal stack from sysconf(_SC_MINSIGSTKSZ), not musl's
static SIGSTKSZ (8192), so the BEAM boots on AMX hosts (AT_MINSIGSTKSZ 11952).

Backport of erlang/otp#11249 + #11376 to maint-27 (erlang/otp#11810, open).
Upstream issues: erlang/otp#11248, erlang/otp#11349. Fixed in OTP 29.1.

